# Ignore everything inside .claude/ except the 6 spec docs + CLAUDE.md (project source of truth)
# Pattern note: must use .claude/* (not .claude/) so negation can re-include specific files
.claude/*
!.claude/PRD-PRODUCTION-READINESS.md
!.claude/TRD.md
!.claude/APP-FLOW.md
!.claude/UI-UX-BRIEF.md
!.claude/BACKEND-SCHEMA.md
!.claude/IMPLEMENTATION-WORKFLOW.md
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/VISUAL-OVERVIEW.md
!.claude/UI-MOCKUPS.html
# Skills: directory visible, but only the project implementation skill + its references ship.
# Other *.skill.md files (export-pipeline, frontend-ui, karpathy-guidelines, oee-analytics,
# shift-handoff, traceability, typescript-patterns) stay local.
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*.skill.md
!.claude/skills/smt-verification-implementation.skill.md
!.claude/skills/references/
!.claude/skills/references/*.md

